string arguments of noise and acxf: instance paths and node names quoted inside the string (the node quoting of 4.5 item 9) and plain
ground 0
load "resistor.osdi"
model vamos_vsource vsource
model vamos_resistor resistor
subckt cell (a b)
  vb (a m1) vamos_vsource type="dc" dc=0 mag=0
  r1 (m1 Mid) vamos_resistor r=1000.0
  r2 (Mid b) vamos_resistor r=1000.0
ends
V1 (in 0) vamos_vsource type="dc" dc=1 mag=1
R1 (in '007') vamos_resistor r=1000.0
R2 ('007' 'net4<0>') vamos_resistor r=1000.0
R3 ('net4<0>' 0) vamos_resistor r=2000.0
I2 (in 0) cell
control
  abort except analysis
  options rawfile="ascii" strictoutput=0
  analysis nzq1 noise out="I2:Mid" in="'I2:vb'" values=[1k]
  analysis nzq2 noise out="'I2:Mid'" in="V1" values=[1k]
  analysis nzq3 noise out="'007'" in="V1" values=[1k]
  analysis nzq4 noise out="'net4<0>'" in="V1" values=[1k]
  analysis xfq1 acxf out="'I2:Mid'" values=[1k]
  analysis nz1 noise out="I2:Mid" in="I2:vb" values=[1k]
  analysis nz2 noise out="007" in="V1" values=[1k]
  analysis nz3 noise out="net4<0>" in="V1" values=[1k]
  analysis xf1 acxf out="I2:Mid" values=[1k]
endc
